### 1. Admin Login (Get JWT Token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@househub.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 2. Customer Registration
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/customer/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hanwant Singh",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "email": "hanwant@example.com",
  "password": "Customer@123",
  "city": "Jodhpur",
  "userType": "RENT"
}

### 3. Broker Registration (Status: PENDING)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/broker/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "mobile": "9123456780",
  "email": "rahul@properties.com",
  "password": "Broker@123",
  "city": "Jodhpur",
  "agencyName": "Sharma Properties",
  "experience": "5 Years"
}

### 4. Public Properties List (No token required)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/properties

### 5. Search Properties (No token required)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/properties/search?city=Jodhpur&purpose=RENT
